OFFICE OF THE HOKAGE — LETTERS OF COMMENDATION (REGISTER)

Commendations are entered into a shinobi's permanent file upon recognition by the Hokage for exceptional service to the village.

Register (summary):
- Team 7 — commended for the Land of Waves escort mission, exceeding rank in confronting the missing-nin Zabuza Momochi and his accomplice.
- Uzumaki, Naruto — repeated commendation for valor in defense of the village and comrades.
- Nara, Shikamaru — commended for tactical command in a genin retrieval operation.
- Haruno, Sakura — commended for battlefield medical support and chakra control.

Commendations carry no automatic rank change but are weighed in promotion review. The Hokage's seal is affixed to each formal letter.

Maintained by the Hokage's administrative staff.
